BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 348.95 Tm (allowances, minimum terms, and export fees. The illustrated ceilings total $1,115 monthly across all twelve layers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 333.72 Tm (including a $50 hardware replacement accrual that is not a subscription. This leaves room inside the $3,500) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 318.50 Tm (core-overhead floor for insurance, communications variability, credentialing administration, and other actual costs, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 303.27 Tm (does not establish that those costs will fit. Reject the configuration if written quotes exceed available cash or required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 288.05 Tm (protections are unavailable. Purchase RouteGenie or MediRoutes only after a realistic route import, driver assignment,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 272.82 Tm (GPS evidence export, cancellation, and reassignment demonstration. For the first narrow pilot, a payer-approved portal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 257.60 Tm (plus a protected manual dispatch ledger can be cheaper than an integration project, provided the workflow meets) Tj ET
